<title>GERMANY: German December car registrations up 0.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German December car registrations up 0.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>FLENSBURG, Germany 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations in Germany fell 10.4 percent in December from the previous month and were up 0.1 percent from December 1995, the Federal Motor Office said.</p>
<p>Registrations were up 5.5 percent in 1996 compared to</p>
<p>1995.</p>
<p>		    DEC	  PCT CHG	   1996     PCT CHG</p>
<p>				 m/m     y/y</p>
<p> Cars	   232,997   -10.4   +0.1    3,496,320    +5.5</p>
<p> Trucks	     801   +77.2   +42.0	 5,876    +9.8</p>
<p> All vehicles 263,617   -10.0   +1.0    4,045,726    +5.9</p>
<p>((-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150))</p>
